  "language": "zh",
  "title": "Comparisons: 比, 没有, 跟…一样, 更, 最, 多, 有点儿",
  "description": "A 比 B + adj (and why 很 can't go there), 没有 for 'not as … as', sameness with 一样, how tall/far with 多, and 有点儿 vs 一点儿.",
  "level": "A2",
  "points": [
    {
      "id": "bi",
      "title": "A 比 B + adjective",
      "summary": "A 比 B + adj = A is more … than B. No 很 / 非常 / 太 before the adjective — use 更 / 还, or put the amount after it.",
      "body": "- 哥哥**比**我高.\n- 他**比**我高**一点儿** / 高**两厘米**.\n- 今天**比**昨天**更**冷.\n- ~~他比我很高~~ ✗",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{今天|jīntiān}{比|bǐ}{昨天|zuótiān}{更|gèng}{冷|lěng}。",
          "Today is even colder than yesterday."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "meiyou_comp",
      "title": "A 没有 B + adjective: not as … as",
      "summary": "A 没有 B (那么) + adj = A isn't as … as B.",
      "body": "- 我**没有**他高 (I'm not as tall as him).\n- 不比 = 'not more … than' (maybe equal) — weaker.",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{我|wǒ}{没有|méiyǒu}{他|tā}{高|gāo}。",
          "I'm not as tall as him."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "yiyang",
      "title": "A 跟 / 和 B 一样 (+ adj)",
      "summary": "A 跟 B 一样 = A is the same as B; 一样 + adj = equally ….",
      "body": "- 我的手机**跟**你的**一样**.\n- 我**跟**他**一样**高.",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{我|wǒ}{跟|gēn}{他|tā}{一样|yíyàng}{高|gāo}。",
          "I'm as tall as him."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "zui",
      "title": "最 + adjective: the most",
      "summary": "最 (zuì) = most / -est.",
      "body": "- 他是我们班**最**高的学生.",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{这|zhè}{是|shì}{我|wǒ}{最|zuì}{喜欢|xǐhuan}{的|de}{菜|cài}。",
          "This is my favourite dish."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "duo",
      "title": "多 + adjective?: how …?",
      "summary": "(有) 多 + adj? asks for an amount: 多高 (how tall), 多远, 多大 (how old), 多长.",
      "body": "- 你**多**高? — 一米八.\n- 长城有**多**长?",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{你|nǐ}{多|duō}{高|gāo}？",
          "How tall are you?"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "youdian",
      "title": "有点儿 vs 一点儿",
      "summary": "有点儿 + adj = a bit (too) …, usually negative, **before** the adjective. Adj + 一点儿 = a bit more …, **after** the adjective (comparisons, requests).",
      "body": "- 今天**有点儿**冷.\n- 便宜**一点儿**吧! / 有没有大**一点儿**的?",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{今天|jīntiān}{有点儿|yǒudiǎnr}{冷|lěng}。",
          "It's a bit cold today."
        ]
      ]
    }
  ],
